{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Backend Experience | Mantas Serapinas{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <main>
        <h1>Backend Experience</h1>

        <section>
            <h2>PHP &amp; Symfony</h2>
            <p>At Timber Cabins, I added features and fixed bugs across country-specific websites. For this portfolio, I built Symfony controllers and restricted admin access with role-based permissions.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>MySQL &amp; Doctrine</h2>
            <p>I modeled projects and users with Doctrine, tracked schema changes in migrations, and used MySQL Workbench to query and update records.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Docker &amp; Code Quality</h2>
            <p>I use Docker Compose to run PHP and MySQL locally, and PHPStan with its Doctrine extension to catch type errors during development.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
{% endblock %}
